{"title": "Soul Echo", "pageid": 56577, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul_Echo", "categories": ["Gameplay mechanics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SoulEcho.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/SoulEcho.png/250px-SoulEcho.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/SoulEcho.png/375px-SoulEcho.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b1/SoulEcho.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/SoulEcho.png/250px-SoulEcho.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/SoulEcho.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The silent reminder of a fallen character</figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Soul Echo</b> is a reminder of a fallen player character, <a href=\"/wiki/Companion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Companion\">companion</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Hireling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hireling\">hireling</a> which appears near the point of their <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">death</a> in case of their body is unavailable (e.g., disappeared in a Chasm). The character portrait in the sidebar in this case features a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Echo_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Echo (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Echo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Soul_Echo_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Echo_(Condition)\" title=\"Soul Echo (Condition)\">Soul Echo</a> icon, in addition to a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Dead (Condition)\">Dead</a> condition icon.\n</p><p>Soul Echo looks like a floating flicker of a blue flame, resembling a will-o-wisp. It can be looted as any dead party member's corpse, preserving all items which were stored in the character's <i>inventory</i> at the moment of their death. However, equipped items like armour and weapons remain unreachable until the character in question is resurrected.\n</p><p>It is possible to use any means of resurrection such as a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\">Scroll of Revivify</a> or the respective skills of a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/20px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/30px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/40px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paladin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png/20px-Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Class_Paladin_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/20px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/30px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/40px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/20px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png/20px-Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png/30px-Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png/40px-Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png/20px-Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Class_Bard_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> on a Soul Echo; all function as if cast on a dead character. The resurrected character appears nearby with 1 hit point.\n</p><p>Party members turned into Soul Echoes can be also revived by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> upon returning to the <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">Campsite</a>.\n</p><p>Flickers of floating flames resembling Soul Echoes also appear in <a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a> while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/38px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/50px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystic Carrion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a> is still alive. He talks to them, calling them \"spirits\", gives them orders and generally mistreats them. These objects are uninteractable.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202052\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1956/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13315/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2523/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/100